  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then the points of discontinuity of the function <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></math> (<math><mi>n</mi></math> times), are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HMb2c",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></math>",
