      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "WT312",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vU4sw",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "kT4tg",
      "text": "continuous everywhere except <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Clearly, <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a point of discontinuity of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> .<br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> , which is continuous&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> .<br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence, <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi></mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> which is continuous everywhere except <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, the only point of discontinuity is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
